// Lily#: a trill spanner on a grand staff's lower staff is drawn from the wrong columns (found
// 2026-10-19 by the OMR; the same as textspan-grandstaff-lower-2026-10-19.lys, in TrillSpannerEngraver).
//
// lh's `d4@startTrillSpan` is lh's second note, but the "tr" is set at the second COLUMN of the
// measure as the upper staff has it (rh's d''8), two and a half spaces too early, and the wave ends
// before rh's fourth column (f''8) instead of before lh's `f4@stopTrillSpan`. In bar 2 the "tr" is
// right (the first column is both staves'), but the wave stops before rh's third column (e''8),
// not before lh's b,4 at beat 4. LilyPond binds the spanner to lh's note columns.
//
// Expected: "tr" at lh's d (beat 2 of bar 1), the wave to just before lh's f; in bar 2 the wave to
// just before lh's b,.
// lysc png --scale 3 trillspan-grandstaff-lower-2026-10-19.lys
title "trill span grand staff"
octave absolute
time 4/4

part rh { clef treble }
part lh { clef bass }

section Piece {
  rh {
    c'''8 d'''8 e'''8 f'''8 g'''8 a'''8 b'''8 c''''8 | c'''8 d'''8 e'''8 f'''8 g'''8 a'''8 b'''8 c''''8 | c'''1 |
  }
  lh {
    c'4 d'4@startTrillSpan e'4 f'4@stopTrillSpan | g2@startTrillSpan a4 b4@stopTrillSpan | c'1 |
  }
}

score { grandStaff { staff rh staff lh } }
